OL,3,AGerman Chancellor Merz calls state
OL,4,Aelection a 'disaster' for his party but
OL,5,Avows to stay on
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile the far-right AfD was on
OL,8,Ftrack to win the most votes in
OL,9,FMecklenburg-Vorpommern.
OL,11,FIn Berlin, the ruling CDU was also
OL,12,Fexpected to be beaten by Die Linke (The
OL,13,FLeft).
